{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to\u00a0<i><strong>Super Serious Golf</strong></i>\u00a0where shot count and accuracy goes out the window. Terrible at golf? Great! Hit your ball as hard as you can, hope for the best and watch the madness unfold in a series of easy-to-learn minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/GolfCart.gif?t=1753705428\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test Your Friendships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tired of having too many friends? Battle it out in <strong>8 player lobbies</strong>\u00a0and watch friendships fall apart. <strong>Bots can also be added\u00a0</strong>to make the chaos even more... chaotic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/4a01683e15efcd89736ce7fbd3958396.poster.avif?t=1753705428\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/4a01683e15efcd89736ce7fbd3958396.webm?t=1753705428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/4a01683e15efcd89736ce7fbd3958396.mp4?t=1753705428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endless Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle it out in over <strong>20 unique minigames</strong>\u00a0and show off your style with over <strong>50 unique hats and trails</strong>\u00a0that are all earned through gameplay. None of those pesky microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/CarChaos.gif?t=1753705428\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Private and public lobbies with up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of minigames and cosmetics to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game mode selection to change up how minigames are played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect interesting powerups to  tip the scales of each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bots to fill out lobbies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514670?t=1753705428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/c07aae07b38dedc352f356908a56c78633cf96c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753705428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/55367d7cf346671b7b41f247552572b18a84f5ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753705428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/55367d7cf346671b7b41f247552572b18a84f5ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753705428","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid"